# Investigation 13 - Counterexample for "add a 3rd LOAD unit"
# 12 uops. Only 2 LOADs, but a 3-deep IMUL chain (single IMUL unit) gates them.
# Adding a 3rd LOAD unit cannot help: loads wait on IMUL, not on LOAD ports.

C00 IMUL R01, R00, R01
C01 IMUL R02, R01, R01
C02 IMUL R03, R02, R01

C03 LOAD R10, [R03 + 0]
C04 LOAD R11, [R03 + 4]

C05 ADD  R04, R10, R11
C06 ADD  R05, R04, R10
C07 ADD  R06, R05, R11
C08 ADD  R07, R06, R04
C09 ADD  R08, R07, R05
C10 ADD  R09, R08, R06
C11 ADD  R12, R09, R07